* Transient storage in practice
** EIP-1153 semantics
*** TLOAD and TSTORE, 100 gas
*** One space per contract
*** Reverted frame rolls back
*** Successful return keeps the value
*** Discarded at transaction end
*** Caller space under DELEGATECALL
*** No TSTORE in a static frame
** Solidity support
*** Yul builtins, 0.8.24
*** transient variables, 0.8.28
*** Value types only
*** Own layout from slot 0
*** No warning 2394 on keyword writes
** Reentrancy locks
*** Transient, 284 to 528 gas
*** Storage guard, 2,327 gas
*** Refund capped at one fifth
*** uint256 cheaper than bool
left side
** What can go wrong
*** Lock not reset breaks batches
*** Assembly return skips the reset
*** Flash-loan flag left open
*** Bundle residue across senders
*** TSTORE under the 2,300 stipend
** Startale
*** Constructor flag stays set
*** 22 accounts, 213.775580 USDC in one tx
*** Nexus fix 40 days earlier
*** Consume the flag when checked
** solc helper collision
*** 0.8.28 to 0.8.33, via-IR
*** delete hits the wrong location
*** Lock stays set, owner zeroed
*** Fixed in 0.8.34
